        <!-- HERO BANNER END-->
      <section class="relative inside-banner-outer overflow-hidden">
         <div class="inside-banner-inner banner-animation relative ">

            <!-- Banner -->
            <div class="rounded-bottom-lr overflow-hidden h-170 rounded-bl-xl rounded-br-xl relative innerbanner-image-wrapper">

               <!-- Parallax Image -->
               <picture>
                  <!-- Desktop -->
                  <source media="(min-width:1024px)"
                     srcset="Assets/images/banners/company-info-banner-desktop.webp">

                  <!-- Tablet -->
                  <source media="(min-width:768px)"
                     srcset="Assets/images/banners/company-info-banner-mob.webp">

                  <!-- Mobile -->
                  <img
                     src="Assets/images/banners/company-info-banner-mob.webp"
                     alt="About Bubble Food"
                     class="innerbanner-image absolute left-0 top-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
                     loading="eager"
                     fetchpriority="high">
               </picture>

               <!-- Keep Existing Overlay -->
               <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/60 via-black/40 to-black/70 z-10"></div>


            </div>

            <!-- Content -->
           
               <div class="innerbanner-caption absolute inset-0 z-30 flex items-end">
                  <div class="container pb-12 md:pb-15">
                     <div class="max-w-4xl text-left">

                        <nav class="mb-4" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                           <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
                              <li>
                                 <a href="/" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition">
                                    Home
                                 </a>
                              </li>

                              <li class="text-white/60">/</li>

                              <li class="text-white">
                                 About Us
                              </li>
                           </ol>
                        </nav>

                        <h1 class="innerbanner-title text-h1 text-white">
                          
                           <span class="innerbanner-title-span">
                              Education
                           </span>
                        </h1>

                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
           

         </div>
      </section>


         <!-- ====================Intro Section Delivering Experiences that Matter ==================== -->
         <section class=" bc-experience-section relative section-spacing overflow-hidden page-intro-section">

            <div class="container relative z-10">
               <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
                  <!-- Left:img  -->
                  <div class="relative">
                  <div class="nourish-media">
                     <img
                        src="Assets/images/education/next_generation.png"
                        alt="Nourishing the Next Generation">
                  </div>
                  </div>
                  <!-- Right: copy -->
                  <div class="relative space-y-6 md:space-y-8 sm:max-w-[35vw]">
                     <div class="section-title-outer mx-auto max-w-5xl">
                        <h2 class="title-section text-h2 " data-leaf-target letters-slide-down text-split>
                          Nourishing the  <span class="text-letters-slide"> Next Generation</span>
                        </h2>
                        
                     </div>
                    <div class="intro-outer-wrapper sm:pl-15">
                     <p>From campus cafeterias and university and school mess operations to academic events and curated student dining experiences, Nekta brings the rigour of institutional catering backed by the Tata legacy, expertise of Indian Hotel Companies and  operational and culinary craft of TajSATS Air Catering Limited to the Indian education segment as a hospitality-backed catering partner.</p>
                     <p>Our partnerships with leading academic institutions demonstrate our capability to perform within highly stringent nutritional, hygiene, and safety frameworks—delivering carefully curated, balanced, and engaging dining programmes that support learning, development, and overall well-being with uncompromising discipline.</p>
                     <div class="flex justify-start mt-5">
                           <a href="#" class="common-btn flex items-center gap-2 btn-slide-fill">
                           <span>Get in Touch</span>
                           <img loading="lazy" src="Assets/images/arrows/creamarrow-long-right.png" alt="rightArrow" />
                           </a>
                        </div>
                     </div>
                  
                  <!-- Decorative leaf bottom-right -->
                  <img loading="lazy" src="Assets/images/intro-leaf/green_leaf_travel.svg" alt="" class="bc-leaf-deco absolute -bottom-6 right-0 md:right-4 w-10 md:w-12" aria-hidden="true" />

                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
         </section>

      
      <!-- ==================== Campus Dining Excellence==================== -->
            <section class="bg-darkcream cd-section section-spacing relative">
               <div class="cd-band bg-green"></div>

               <div class="container cd-inner relative">

               <div class="cd-stamp cd-stamp-1" data-cd="stamp">
                  
                  <img loading="lazy" src="Assets/images/education/bowl-steam-rice.webp" alt="" class="bowl" aria-hidden="true" />
                
               </div>

               <img loading="lazy" src="Assets/images/education/students.webp" alt="Students reviewing a campus dining menu together"
                  class="cd-photo cd-photo-1" data-cd="photo" data-from="left" />

                  <div class="cd-copy">
                  <!-- Section Heading -->
               <div class="section-title-outer text-center mx-auto max-w-7xl">
                  <h2 class="title-section text-h2 " data-leaf-target letters-slide-down text-split>
                    Campus Dining   <span class="text-letters-slide"> Excellence</span>
                  </h2>
                 
               </div>
                     <p data-cd="para">As a new-age catering partner, Nekta designs and manages dining programmes for schools, colleges, and universities that seamlessly balance nutrition, safety, and consistency&mdash;delivering at scale without compromise.</p>
                     <p data-cd="para">Our approach goes beyond meal delivery. From well-structured mess plans and chef-curated menus to convenient grab-and-go formats and engaging themed food activations, we create integrated dining experiences. Each offering is thoughtfully designed around nutritional balance while reflecting the elevated standards of modern campus dining&mdash;supporting student well-being, engagement, and performance.</p>


                  </div>

               <div class="cd-stamp cd-stamp-2" data-cd="stamp">
           
                  <img loading="lazy" src="Assets/images/education/soup.webp" alt="" class="bowl" aria-hidden="true" />
         
               </div>

               <img loading="lazy" src="Assets/images/education/meal.webp" alt="A campus dining spread of freshly prepared dishes"
                  class="cd-photo cd-photo-3" data-cd="photo" data-from="right" />
               <img loading="lazy" src="Assets/images/education/burger.webp" alt="Two students sharing a meal on campus"
                  class="cd-photo cd-photo-2" data-cd="photo" data-from="bottom" />

               </div>
            </section>

